## Pages

- [Home]({{ site.url }}/): who Andrew is, what he works on now, and where to go next.
- [Bio]({{ site.url }}/bio/): full professional background, role history and areas of expertise. Also offers the same bio as copyable Markdown and plain text, for reuse in event programs and introductions.
