- [Writing]({{ site.url }}/writing/): index of published writing and research, with links out to where each piece lives.
- [Contact]({{ site.url }}/contact/): how to reach Andrew — email, a Calendly link for booking time, and social profiles. There is no contact form.
- [Holiday Update 2025]({{ site.url }}/holiday-update-2025/): a personal year-end letter, not professional content.

