## Notes for agents

- Every page is server-rendered static HTML; nothing here needs JavaScript to read. Client-side
  scripts only add a countdown and relative-time labels on the travel page.
- Each page carries schema.org `Person` JSON-LD in its `<head>`, which is the most reliable
  machine-readable source for identity, role and expertise.
- A full URL list with last-modified dates is at [{{ site.url }}/sitemap.xml]({{ site.url }}/sitemap.xml).
- Crawling is welcome; see [{{ site.url }}/robots.txt]({{ site.url }}/robots.txt). Please attribute
  quotes to {{ site.url }} and the page you took them from.
- Dates on the speaking and travel pages are authored by hand and are the source of truth; do not
  infer a schedule from anything else on the site.
